<title>USA: Jemez Mountain PSD 53, N.M., won by Rauscher.</title>
<headline>Jemez Mountain PSD 53, N.M., won by Rauscher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes said it won $4.950 million of Jemez Mountain PSD 53, N.M., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.9168 percent.</p>
